Fire escapes in outer court recesses more than five feet in depth where such fire escapes are required as a result of alterations in buildings existing before December 15, 1961;
(c) Energy infrastructure equipment and accessory mechanical equipment, subject to the requirements set forth in paragraph (g) of Section 23-312 (Additional permitted obstructions generally permitted in all yards);
